Package: wikibaser
Title: Tools for MediaWiki, Wikibase and Wikidata Federation
Version: 0.0.21
Authors@R: 
    person(given="Daniel", family="Antal", 
           email= "daniel.antal@dataobservatory.eu", 
            role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7513-6760"))
Description: Provides a lightweight interface to the MediaWiki Action API for
    working with Wikibase repositories and Wikidata. Supports authentication,
    entity and file operations, and simple federation workflows between
    Wikibase instances and Wikidata.
URL: https://wikibaser.dataobservatory.eu/
